    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/186fba1e969adfdc180b744c64952626.poster.avif?t=1740428370\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/186fba1e969adfdc180b744c64952626.webm?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/186fba1e969adfdc180b744c64952626.mp4?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>F.E.R.A.S: The Mystery of Future Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspector Irene <i>Capi</i> has vanished. Her last communication indicated that she had uncovered something important on the isolated and highly advanced <i>W3bbed</i> Island. Now, it\u2019s up to you, Agent <i>Dilo Hardshell</i>, a spy from the F.E.R.A.S headquarters, to embark on this mission to uncover this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is a hub of cutting-edge technology unknown to our intelligence team. Its robotic inhabitants \u2014 like the Legged Fish, the Boxing Lobster, and the Turbocharged Seagull \u2014 will stop at nothing to hinder your progress. Combining your agility and cunning, you\u2019ll need to utilize your unique skills and our top-tier gadgets to solve the puzzle that the <i>W3bbed</i> Corporation is weaving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/45488b329aa1921d4ef65310af9ad168.poster.avif?t=1740428370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/45488b329aa1921d4ef65310af9ad168.webm?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/45488b329aa1921d4ef65310af9ad168.mp4?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.E.R.A.S: The Mystery of Future Island</strong> is an unforgettable, personality-filled adventure that blends traditional FPS combat with the dynamic thrill of rolling around as a secret agent armadillo.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/186fba1e969adfdc180b744c64952626.poster.avif?t=1740428370\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/186fba1e969adfdc180b744c64952626.webm?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/186fba1e969adfdc180b744c64952626.mp4?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>F.E.R.A.S: The Mystery of Future Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspector Irene <i>Capi</i> has vanished. Her last communication indicated that she had uncovered something important on the isolated and highly advanced <i>W3bbed</i> Island. Now, it\u2019s up to you, Agent <i>Dilo Hardshell</i>, a spy from the F.E.R.A.S headquarters, to embark on this mission to uncover this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is a hub of cutting-edge technology unknown to our intelligence team. Its robotic inhabitants \u2014 like the Legged Fish, the Boxing Lobster, and the Turbocharged Seagull \u2014 will stop at nothing to hinder your progress. Combining your agility and cunning, you\u2019ll need to utilize your unique skills and our top-tier gadgets to solve the puzzle that the <i>W3bbed</i> Corporation is weaving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/45488b329aa1921d4ef65310af9ad168.poster.avif?t=1740428370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/45488b329aa1921d4ef65310af9ad168.webm?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382740/extras/45488b329aa1921d4ef65310af9ad168.mp4?t=1740428370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.E.R.A.S: The Mystery of Future Island</strong> is an unforgettable, personality-filled adventure that blends traditional FPS combat with the dynamic thrill of rolling around as a secret agent armadillo.</p>",
    "short_description": "F.E.R.A.S: The Mystery of Future Island is a dynamic and unforgettable FPS where you play as a secret agent armadillo. Blending intense battles with the unique ability to roll through environments and tackle challenges, the game delivers a one-of-a-kind action-packed experience.",
